      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYS B COOL NZ (12) is a progressive gelding who returned from a spell in very good order last time out, digging deep to score at this circuit and distance. That continued a string of wins and placings from the maiden campaign and he has been kept up to the mark with a trial. May need an ounce of luck from this draw but looks bound for better things. BEYOND DOUBT NZ (3) turned in a good performance last start when he battled on bravely for third at this venue, giving him two wins and two placings from the last four outings. Has had seven weeks off but was kept up to the mark with a trial and has the benefit of a good draw. COSMIC FLYER (1) overcame a wide barrier in a last-start win by 1.4 metres at this circuit and distance. The ace draw can see him competitive. SHES CRUNCHY NZ (9) draws on the back line but is two from two when third-up so should be peaking and looks close to a win after back-to-back placings here.",
